@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
hide empty description

state "Not on leave" as NotOnLeave
state "On leave" as OnLeave
state "Leave ended" as Ended
Ended : The date stays in the data file,
Ended : but the contact is shown
Ended : as not on leave.

[*] --> NotOnLeave : add without lv/
[*] --> OnLeave : add with lv/DATE

NotOnLeave --> OnLeave : edit lv/DATE
OnLeave --> OnLeave : edit lv/NEW_DATE
OnLeave --> Ended : the day after DATE begins
OnLeave --> NotOnLeave : edit lv/
Ended --> OnLeave : edit lv/DATE
Ended --> NotOnLeave : edit lv/
@enduml
